    measured; PhaseThresholds ride that count at the rail prism''s nominal volume plus a
    trail band. Flora and fauna: Yggdra Cell/Yggdra Cell Config''s spawn profile. Regenerate
    with Tools/Build/author_regatta_assets.py from Tools/Build/regatta_shuffle_pool.json,
    never by hand.'
